OL,3,GNEWSAPoverty affecting children's
OL,4,Arights, report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new report shows childhood poverty is
OL,7,Faffecting young people's rights,
OL,8,Fopportunities and relationships.
OL,10,FMore than 130 children responded to the
OL,11,F"Less Money, More Stress" report, the
OL,12,Ffirst major study carried about by the
OL,13,FOffice of the Children's Commissioner
OL,14,Ffor Jersey.
OL,16,FThe report highlighted how
OL,17,Fapproximately one in four children
OL,18,Flived in relatively low-income
OL,19,Ffamilies, with some young people saying
OL,20,Fthey feared they would have to leave
OL,21,FJersey because of its high costs of
OL,22,Fliving.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
