OL,3,GNEWSAPoverty affecting children's
OL,4,Arights, report
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren's Commissioner Dr Carmel
OL,7,FCorrigan said: "Child poverty is a
OL,8,Fchildren's rights issue... When
OL,9,Ffamilies struggle to afford essentials,
OL,10,Fchildren's ability to enjoy many of
OL,11,Ftheir rights can be affected."
